%% Yole - Network Protocol Service Lifecycle
%% Sequence diagram showing connection, operations, and resource management

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Platform App
    participant SVC as Protocol Service<br/>(e.g., DropboxService)
    participant AUTH as AuthTokenManager
    participant OAuth as OAuth2Flow
    participant HTTP as HttpClient (Ktor)
    participant RL as RateLimiter
    participant API as Remote API

    Note over User,API: Service Construction

    User->>App: Configure storage connection
    App->>App: Create StorageConfig<br/>(e.g., DropboxConfig with<br/>appKey, appSecret, accessToken)
    App->>SVC: new DropboxService(config)
    SVC->>AUTH: AuthTokenManager("dropbox")
    Note over SVC: HttpClient initialized lazily

    Note over User,API: Connection Phase

    App->>SVC: connect()
    SVC->>AUTH: hasValidToken()
    AUTH->>AUTH: Check SecureStorage<br/>for access token + expiration

    alt Token valid
        AUTH-->>SVC: true
    else Token expired, refresh token available
        AUTH-->>SVC: false
        SVC->>OAuth: refreshToken(refreshToken)
        OAuth->>HTTP: POST /oauth2/token
        HTTP->>API: Token refresh request
        API-->>HTTP: New access + refresh tokens
        HTTP-->>OAuth: TokenResponse
        OAuth-->>SVC: New tokens
        SVC->>AUTH: storeTokenInfo(accessToken,<br/>refreshToken, expiresIn)
    else No tokens at all
        SVC-->>App: Result.failure("Not authenticated")
        Note over App: Must complete OAuth2 flow first
    end

    SVC->>HTTP: GET /2/users/get_current_account
    HTTP->>API: Validate connection
    API-->>HTTP: Account info
    HTTP-->>SVC: Connection confirmed
    SVC->>SVC: isOnline = true
    SVC-->>App: Result.success()

    Note over User,API: File Operations

    App->>SVC: listFiles("/documents")
    SVC->>RL: Check rate limit
    RL-->>SVC: Permitted

    SVC->>HTTP: POST /2/files/list_folder
    HTTP->>API: List folder request
    API-->>HTTP: JSON response
    HTTP-->>SVC: File listing
    SVC->>SVC: Parse JSON to List<NetworkDocument>
    SVC-->>App: Flow<Result<List<NetworkDocument>>>

    App->>SVC: uploadFile(localPath, remotePath)
    SVC->>RL: Check rate limit
    RL-->>SVC: Permitted
    SVC->>SVC: Create NetworkOperation(UPLOAD)
    SVC->>HTTP: POST content.dropboxapi.com<br/>/2/files/upload
    HTTP->>API: Upload bytes
    API-->>HTTP: File metadata
    HTTP-->>SVC: Upload complete
    SVC->>SVC: Update operation status: COMPLETED
    SVC->>SVC: Update sync status map
    SVC-->>App: Flow<NetworkOperation>

    App->>SVC: downloadFile(remotePath, localPath)
    SVC->>RL: Check rate limit
    RL-->>SVC: Permitted
    SVC->>SVC: Create NetworkOperation(DOWNLOAD)
    SVC->>HTTP: POST content.dropboxapi.com<br/>/2/files/download
    HTTP->>API: Download request
    API-->>HTTP: File bytes
    HTTP-->>SVC: Download complete
    SVC->>SVC: Update cache entry
    SVC-->>App: Flow<NetworkOperation>

    Note over User,API: Error Handling and Rate Limiting

    App->>SVC: deleteFile("/path/to/file")
    SVC->>RL: Check rate limit

    alt Rate limited (429)
        RL-->>SVC: Throttled -- wait
        SVC->>SVC: Backoff delay
        SVC->>HTTP: Retry after delay
        HTTP->>API: Delete request
        API-->>HTTP: Success
    else API error (500)
        HTTP->>API: Delete request
        API-->>HTTP: Server error
        SVC->>SVC: Retry (up to maxRetries=3)
    end

    SVC-->>App: Result<Unit>

    Note over User,API: Disconnection and Cleanup

    App->>SVC: disconnect()
    SVC->>SVC: Cancel background coroutines
    SVC->>HTTP: close()
    SVC->>SVC: isOnline = false
    SVC->>SVC: Clear in-memory caches
    SVC-->>App: Result.success()
